Axor Enterprise Edition — Commercial License
=============================================

The code in this `ee/` directory is the Enterprise Edition of the Axor Control
Plane. Unlike the rest of this repository (Apache-2.0, see the repository-root
LICENSE), it is licensed commercially.

- **Source-visible, not free-to-use.** The source is published so security
  buyers can audit everything they run — nothing about the license check or the
  EE features is hidden. Publication is not a grant of the right to use these
  features in production.

- **Production use requires a valid Axor EE license** (an Ed25519-signed license
  file — org, tier, node ceiling, expiry — verified offline; see
  monetization-v0.1.md §4). The EE features check it at startup; an expired
  license degrades gracefully to read-only EE and NEVER disables any safety
  feature.

- **Permitted without a commercial license:** reading, auditing, and modifying
  this source for evaluation and security review. Running the EE features to
  provide the enterprise capabilities they implement, in production, is not.

For a commercial license, contact the Axor authors. Everything an individual
needs is Apache-2.0 and free forever; you pay only for organizational features —
never for safety, never for hosting per se.
